        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sheldon Harnick, Richard Ney, Louis Bellson, Will Irwin, Jerry Bock\n- Works: Portofino, Fiddler on the Roof\n- Roles: lyricist, composer, book writer\n- Topics: musical theater collaborations\n\nFacts:\n- Sheldon Harnick was born on April 30, 1924.\n- Sheldon Harnick is an American lyricist.\n- Sheldon Harnick is best known for collaborations with composer Jerry Bock on musicals such as Fiddler on the Roof.\n- Portofino is a musical.\n- Richard Ney wrote the book for Portofino.\n- Richard Ney and Sheldon Harnick wrote the lyrics for Portofino.\n- Louis Bellson and Will Irwin composed the music for Portofino.",
